      "body": "PR #1123 raised. On linux it looks like this:\r\n\r\n![gauge_telemetry](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/389148/43198154-485ecade-902b-11e8-9583-a1ecc78cbdfd.gif)\r\n\r\nNote that running either `gauge telemetry on`,  `gauge telemetry off` or setting `GAUGE_TELEMETRY_ENABLED` environment variable will cause gauge to mark the preference recorded and will not show the warning in that machine.",
