      "updated_at": "2018-07-25T12:28:18Z",
      "body": "have you verified if this is in compliance with the GDPR (https://gdpr-info.eu) from the European Union ?\r\n\r\nI am by far an expert here, but from what I got and what emails I received its basically that the user MUST approve any (personal ?) data that is collected, which would mean that you need actually an OPT IN per default, instead of an opt out.\r\n\r\nBut as said, I'm not sure here - nevertheless, as you are collecting data, I would make sure that this is compliant with european law",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "pin": null,
